<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASTAD, Sweden 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results from</p>
<p>the Swedish Open tennis tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Juan-Antonio Marin (Spain) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-3</p>
</text>
